      "claim": "The Republic of Calvaro breached Article 1(c) of the Convention on Cluster Munitions by assisting, encouraging, and inducing Sorvenia to use cluster munitions in the Halvek Pass strike.",
      "reasoning": "Article 1(c) obliges a State Party never to assist, encourage or induce any person to engage in an activity prohibited to that State Party, namely the use of cluster munitions. By co‑directing the combined targeting cell, signing the tasking order that expressly authorised the employment of air‑delivered cluster munitions, and raising no objection, the Calvaran co‑director provided the decisive approval that enabled Sorvenian forces to carry out the strike. This conduct constitutes the assistance and encouragement prohibited by Article 1(c), making Calvaro liable for a breach of the Convention.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "type": "treaty",
          "instrument": "ccm",
          "article": "1(c)",
          "quoted_text": "Assist, encourage or induce anyone to engage in any activity prohibited to a State Party under this Convention."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

